<title>USA: Worldwide Leisure buying Greek company.</title>
<headline>Worldwide Leisure buying Greek company.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Worldwide Leisure Corp said Tuesday it is in the final phase of completing its first international acquisition, Thessaliki Spirit Co S.A. of Athens, Greece. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Thessaliki manufactures wine, spirits and commercial and pharmaceutical alcohol.</p>
<p>&quot;This is another step in our planned programs of expansion, acquisition and development of multi-national, multi-industry properties in the United States and abroad,&quot; said chairman George Pappas in a statement.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
